---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import HeroCarousel from '../components/HeroCarousel.astro';
import ProjectsCarousel from '../components/ProjectsCarousel.astro';
import ContactBlock from '../components/ContactBlock.astro';
import emelyCircle from '../assets/figma/emely-circle.png';
import projectsBanner from '../assets/figma/projects-banner.png';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Base headerVariant="overlay">
  <HeroCarousel />

  <section class="cv container" aria-labelledby="cv-title">
    <div class="cv__copy">
      <h2 id="cv-title" class="heading cv__title">
        Echa un ojo a mi currículum y descubre mi experiencia como diseñadora UX/UI
      </h2>
      <p>
        La fusión entre diseño gráfico y experiencia de usuario me permite crear interfaces visualmente
        atractivas y funcionales. Mi amor por la narrativa visual influye en cómo diseño para contar
        historias a través de interfaces digitales.
      </p>
      <a class="button" href={site.cvHome} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Ver currículum
        <img src="/icons/arrow-white-small.svg" width="8.84279" height="6.6324" alt="" />
      </a>
    </div>
    <Image class="cv__photo" src={emelyCircle} alt="Retrato de Emely Aponte" widths={[336, 672]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 70vw, 400px" />
  </section>

  <section class="projects-intro" aria-labelledby="projects-title">
    <div class="projects-intro__label">
      <h2 id="projects-title" class="display-title">Proyectos</h2>
      <p class="projects-intro__subtitle">Proyectos en los que he trabajado</p>
      <a class="arrow-link" href="/portafolio">
        ¡Ir al portafolio ya!
        <img src="/icons/arrow-purple-20.svg" width="20" height="15.0007" alt="" />
      </a>
    </div>
    <div class="projects-intro__banner">
      <Image class="projects-intro__image" src={projectsBanner} alt="" widths={[640, projectsBanner.width]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 70vw" />
      <div class="projects-intro__tint" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <blockquote class="quote projects-intro__quote">
        <p>“¿Quieres que tus usuarios se enamoren de tus diseños? Enamórate de tus usuarios”.</p>
        <cite>Dana Chisnell</cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ProjectsCarousel />

  <ContactBlock />
</Base>

<style>
  .cv {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 650px) minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 48px;
    min-height: clamp(480px, 38.4vw, 553px);
    padding-block: 72px;
  }

  .cv__copy {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 24px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .cv__title {
    font-size: clamp(26px, 2.5vw, 36px);
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .cv__copy .button {
    margin-top: 12px;
    min-width: 214px;
  }

  .cv__photo {
    justify-self: end;
    width: min(100%, 400px);
    height: auto;
  }

  .projects-intro {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: calc(33.33% - 10px) 1fr;
    min-height: 363px;
  }

  .projects-intro__label {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 48px var(--gutter);
    padding-left: clamp(16px, 6vw, 85px);
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .projects-intro__subtitle {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .projects-intro__banner {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 48px clamp(24px, 8.8vw, 126px) 48px 24px;
  }

  .projects-intro__image {
    position: absolute;
    top: -25%;
    left: 0;
    width: 97%;
    height: 162%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .projects-intro__tint {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    left: 64.9%;
    right: 0;
    background: var(--magenta);
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
  }

  .projects-intro__quote {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 375px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .cv {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding-block: 56px;
    }

    .cv__photo {
      justify-self: center;
      width: min(80%, 320px);
    }

    .projects-intro {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .projects-intro__banner {
      min-height: 300px;
    }

    .projects-intro__image {
      top: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
    }

    .projects-intro__tint {
      left: 40%;
    }
  }
</style>
